name: sim.getScriptName
description: 
luaSynopsis: string scriptName=sim.getScriptName(int scriptHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. scriptHandle: handle of the script, or sim.handle_self for the handle of the current script
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. scriptName: name of the script if associated with a scene object, empty string if the script is the main script, or the name of the add-on if the script is an add-on.
